{id:F2, verdict:GAP, evidence:"v2 line31 đòi reseed trong read_file_range; real orchestrator/tools/read/fs.py:102-171 chỉ read, file_group lookup lines148-154, không update INDEX. Insertion đúng là sau _read có raw bytes/selected + trước return, nhưng reseed-on-read tạo TOCTOU nếu stat/hash lấy sau read: đọc stale bytes, external write chen vào, reseed theo disk mới, write stale pass guard.", fix-proposal-minimal:"Implement stable-read token: stat_before→read bytes/hash→stat_after; chỉ reseed nếu mtime/size unchanged, ghi read_hash/read_mtime/read_region per-path; default không force nếu unstable; force_reseed audited; write guard so read_token vs disk current."}
{id:F3, verdict:GAP, evidence:"v2 line32 có denylist system-dirs nhưng chưa concrete; hiện escape_project_root core.py:305-315 chỉ resolve absolute path ngoài root, không deny; AUD_KILO lines38-42/AUD_OPE lines33-37 xác nhận audit-after-write không phòng.", fix-proposal-minimal:"Deny: C:/Windows, C:/Program Files*, C:/ProgramData, drive roots, %SystemRoot%, %USERPROFILE% dot/secrets (.ssh,.config,.aws,.azure) trừ whitelist Anh. Forbid write-tools to live files: A_ROOT/.orchestrator_cache/{sessions.db,graph.db*,missions.db*}, A_ROOT/.council/council_config.json + inbox/outbox/live logs, A_ROOT/orchestrator.log*, examples/CORE_RULE.txt, ToolQ/librarian.db*. Allow only via dedicated tools: session/cbm/mission/council_config_sync/logger/Q API."}
{id:F7, verdict:GAP, evidence:"orchestrator_server.py:59/72 defines LOG_FILE + FileHandler; /api/logs tails LOG_FILE at orchestrator_server.py:6829-6855; get_usage_stats reads Path(__file__).parent/orchestrator.log at code_tools.py:4274-4288; orchestrator_ui.py:12/106 tails literal orchestrator.log.", fix-proposal-minimal:"RotatingFileHandler is safe only if base file remains orchestrator.log. If dashboard access-log is split, update get_usage_stats and any dashboard stats to read the new access log (or merge both); add AC that /api/logs and usage stats still show recent HTTP after rotation."}
{id:F1-F3, verdict:GAP, evidence:"v2 AC-F1/F2/F3 lines30-32 miss negative/race cases: F1 no 2-writer; F2 no external-write-between-read/reseed; F3 no dedicated-tool bypass/deny verification for live DB/log/config.", fix-proposal-minimal:"Add release blockers: concurrent same-file fallback no corruption; read stale→external write→write blocked; write-tool denied for live DB/log/config while dedicated API still passes; ledger records REJECTED intent before result."}
